# This repository does not use Git LFS. The oversized source workbooks that
# previously motivated LFS are hosted separately; see LARGE_FILES.md.
#
# Byte fidelity is the priority here: this tree is validated against the
# SHA-256 manifest in transfer_metadata/, so Git must not rewrite line endings.
# Several source CSVs are genuinely CRLF, and normalizing them to LF would make
# them fail `shasum -a 256 -c`. Everything is therefore checked in verbatim.
* -text

# Mark the non-diffable research artifacts explicitly, for readable diffs.
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.xls  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip  binary
*.bin  binary
